ra2-modern-israel-name = Israel
ra2-modern-israel-description = Fictional RTS faction: precision armor, protected support and guided fire.
    Includes economy, production, land, air, naval and support buildings.
    New local development roster; balance and final art approval pending.

levant-r2ilrifle-name = Rifle Team
levant-r2ilrifle-description = Three-round burst infantry. Deploy to brace: +18% range, 20% faster fire and 28% less incoming damage. Moving ends the brace. Weak against armor and aircraft.

levant-r2ilat-name = Anti-Armor Team
levant-r2ilat-description = Guided anti-armor missiles with a two-cell minimum range. Marked targets take extra damage. Screen against infantry and close rushes.

levant-r2ilobserver-name = Forward Observer
levant-r2ilobserver-description = Marks ground and naval targets for eight seconds. Only this faction's guided weapons gain bonus damage. Detects cloaked units; no direct damage.

levant-r2ilrecon-name = Recon Specialist
levant-r2ilrecon-description = One elite reconnaissance specialist with a precision double-tap, demolition ability and a timed precision air strike. Fragile against concentrated fire.

levant-r2merkava-name = Merkava Battle Tank
levant-r2merkava-description = Durable armored anchor with a 120 mm cannon. Benefits from a powered coordination relay. Expensive and slow; vulnerable to air attacks and flanking anti-armor teams.

levant-r2ilshield-name = Mobile Air Shield
levant-r2ilshield-description = Long-range radar-guided anti-air missiles. Cannot engage ground targets. Protect with infantry and armor.

levant-r2ilhowitzer-name = Siege Howitzer
levant-r2ilhowitzer-description = Tracked artillery with a four-cell minimum range. Guided shells hit marked targets harder. Requires an escort and room to withdraw.

levant-r2namer-name = Namer Support Carrier
levant-r2namer-description = Protected carrier for five infantry, with a cannon and a slow-reloading anti-armor missile. Durable but expensive. Unload infantry before an ambush.

levant-r2ilfalcon-name = Falcon Multirole Jet
levant-r2ilfalcon-description = Multirole aircraft with separate air and ground missile magazines. Returns to its air service building to rearm. Requires advanced technology.

levant-r2ilgunship-name = Escort Gunship
levant-r2ilgunship-description = Attack helicopter with a chain gun and guided anti-armor rockets. Marked targets take extra rocket damage. Keep clear of anti-air coverage.

levant-r2ilpatrol-name = Coastal Patrol Craft
levant-r2ilpatrol-description = Fast cannon patrol craft. Sonar reveals submarines. Screens light boats but loses to heavy ships.

levant-r2ilfrigate-name = Shield Frigate
levant-r2ilfrigate-description = Naval gun, anti-air and depth charges. Limited interceptor magazine deflects missiles. Active radar increases coverage but reveals the ship.

levant-r2iltender-name = Fleet Support Tender
levant-r2iltender-description = Unarmed fleet support. Nearby eligible ships repair and frigate interceptors reload faster. Escort this vulnerable ship.

levant-r2ilsentry-name = Sentry Emplacement
levant-r2ilsentry-description = Powered anti-infantry defense. Weak against armor, artillery and aircraft.

levant-r2ilbattery-name = Interceptor Battery
levant-r2ilbattery-description = Powered long-range anti-air defense with a two-cell minimum range. Cannot fire at ground targets. This is an aircraft defense, not a universal missile shield.

levant-r2ilatpost-name = Anti-Armor Emplacement
levant-r2ilatpost-description = Powered guided anti-armor missiles with a two-cell minimum range. Marked ground and naval targets take extra damage. Close infantry and artillery counter it.

# Original project faction names and descriptions.

ra2-r2ilrifle-name = Israel National Guard
ra2-r2ilrifle-description = Durable three-round burst infantry. Deploy to brace: +18% range,
    20% faster fire and 28% less damage; moving ends the brace.
    Weak vs armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2ilat-name = ATGM Team
ra2-r2ilat-description = Slow, long-range guided anti-armor missile. Minimum range: 2
    cells.
    Laser-marked targets take extra damage. Weak vs infantry.

ra2-r2ilobserver-name = Israel JTAC
ra2-r2ilobserver-description = Laser-marks ground and naval targets for 8 seconds. Only
    Israel guided weapons deal extra damage to marked targets.
    Detects cloaked units. No direct damage; requires radar.

ra2-r2ilrecon-name = Falcon One
ra2-r2ilrecon-description = Elite commando with a suppressed precision double-tap and C4.
    Calls one F-15SA precision strike every 72 seconds.
    Maximum one. Weak vs armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2ilrecon-strike-name = Falcon Precision Strike
ra2-r2ilrecon-strike-description = An F-15SA drops a precision bomb on the target.
    Laser-marked targets take heavy extra damage.

ra2-r2merkava-name = M1A2S Battle Tank
ra2-r2merkava-description = Heavily armored, expensive main battle tank with an accurate
    120 mm gun. Slow; vulnerable to massed anti-armor ambushes.

ra2-r2ilshield-name = Mobile Air Defense System
ra2-r2ilshield-description = Radar-guided long-range interceptor with extended sight.
    Cannot attack ground targets. Requires radar.

ra2-r2ilhowitzer-name = CAESAR Howitzer
ra2-r2ilhowitzer-description = Fast wheeled 155 mm artillery. Minimum range: 4 cells; the
    chassis must turn to fire.
    Laser-guided shells hit marked targets harder. Needs an escort.

ra2-r2namer-name = Bradley IFV
ra2-r2namer-description = Tracked carrier for five infantry with a 25 mm cannon and a
    long-reload TOW launcher.
    Light armor; keep it behind the tanks.

ra2-r2ilfalcon-name = F-15SA Eagle
ra2-r2ilfalcon-description = Multirole fighter: four air-to-air missiles and two guided
    strike missiles; returns to Airforce Command to rearm.
    Requires Battle Lab.

ra2-r2ilgunship-name = AH-64E Apache
ra2-r2ilgunship-description = Attack helicopter with a chain gun and anti-armor rockets.
    Rockets hit laser-marked targets harder. Vulnerable to anti-air.
    Requires Battle Lab.

ra2-r2ilpatrol-name = Al Sadiq Fast Interceptor
ra2-r2ilpatrol-description = Fast patrol craft with a rapid cannon, strong vs boats and light
    targets. Sonar spots submarines. Weak vs heavy ships.

ra2-r2ilfrigate-name = Al Riyadh Frigate
ra2-r2ilfrigate-description = Multi-role frigate: naval gun, CIWS anti-air and depth charges.
    Interceptor magazine deflects missiles. Deploy active radar for
    wider sensors and interception; emission reveals the frigate.

ra2-r2iltender-name = Al Jubail Support Ship
ra2-r2iltender-description = Unarmed replenishment ship. Repairs nearby Israel ships and
    reloads frigate interceptors faster. Requires radar; escort it.

ra2-r2ilsentry-name = Guard Tower
ra2-r2ilsentry-description = Machine-gun tower against infantry. Requires power.
    Weak vs armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2ilbattery-name = Patriot Battery
ra2-r2ilbattery-description = Longest-range air defense. Minimum range: 2 cells. Cannot
    attack ground targets. Requires radar and power.

ra2-r2ilatpost-name = TOW Emplacement
ra2-r2ilatpost-description = Guided anti-armor missiles against vehicles and ships.
    Minimum range: 2 cells. Requires radar and power.
levant-r2ilrelay-name = Coordination Relay
levant-r2ilrelay-description = Powered six-cell support and five-cell cloak detection. Eligible infantry and vehicles reload 15% faster; bonuses do not stack.
levant-r2ilworkshop-name = Field Service Station
levant-r2ilworkshop-description = Powered four-cell repair zone for eligible vehicles. Repairs two health per second only below 70% health. Bonuses do not stack; protect this unarmed structure.
